WEBVTT

00:04:58.527 --> 00:05:01.500
But I don't think
that there was ill intent.

00:05:02.974 --> 00:05:04.594
AG: I want to dig more into that,

00:05:04.618 --> 00:05:06.261
but first let me tell you actually

00:05:06.285 --> 00:05:08.656
about my first introduction to WeWork.

00:05:09.357 --> 00:05:12.223
So summer 2017,

00:05:12.247 --> 00:05:14.367
I had been talking to the TED team

00:05:14.391 --> 00:05:17.334
about starting this WorkLife podcast,

00:05:17.358 --> 00:05:19.785
and I mentioned it
to a few friends of mine

00:05:19.809 --> 00:05:22.100
and a couple of colleagues,
and one of them said,

00:05:22.124 --> 00:05:23.864
"Oh, you've got to talk to WeWork,

00:05:23.888 --> 00:05:26.846
because they're all about
trying to make work better."

00:05:27.349 --> 00:05:30.731
And before I knew it,
I was being introduced to Adam,